    {
      "kind": "utterance",
      "external_id": "u_c1_diplomatic_disagreement_concede",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "c1-diplomatic-disagreement-01",
        "text": {
          "en": "I can concede that the proposal is simpler to implement; my objection is that simplicity is being treated as the main criterion."
        },
        "translations": {
          "fa": "می‌تونم بپذیرم که اجرای پیشنهاد ساده‌تره؛ ایراد من اینه که سادگی داره معیار اصلی فرض می‌شه."
        },
        "intent": "concede_then_object",
        "concept_refs": [
          "c1_diplomatic_disagreement_concede",
          "c1_diplomatic_disagreement_objection"
        ],
        "cefr": "C1",
        "topic": "polite-language",
        "register": "neutral",
        "status": "approved"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "utterance",
      "external_id": "u_c1_diplomatic_disagreement_premise",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "c1-diplomatic-disagreement-01",
        "text": {
          "en": "I would challenge the premise rather than the conclusion, because the conclusion follows if that premise is accepted."
        },
        "translations": {
          "fa": "من بیشتر پیش‌فرض رو به چالش می‌کشم تا نتیجه رو، چون اگر اون پیش‌فرض پذیرفته بشه نتیجه منطقیه."
        },
        "intent": "challenge_premise",
        "concept_refs": [
          "c1_diplomatic_disagreement_challenge",
          "c1_diplomatic_disagreement_premise"
        ],
        "cefr": "C1",
        "topic": "polite-language",
        "register": "neutral",
        "status": "approved"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "utterance",
      "external_id": "u_c1_diplomatic_disagreement_constructive",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "c1-diplomatic-disagreement-02",
        "text": {
          "en": "A constructive disagreement should make the alternative reasoning visible instead of simply saying the other view is wrong."
        },
        "translations": {
          "fa": "مخالفت سازنده باید منطق جایگزین رو روشن کنه، نه اینکه فقط بگه دیدگاه طرف مقابل غلطه."
        },
        "intent": "define_constructive_disagreement",
        "concept_refs": [
          "c1_diplomatic_disagreement_constructive",
          "c1_diplomatic_disagreement_dismiss"
        ],
        "cefr": "C1",
        "topic": "polite-language",
        "register": "neutral",
        "status": "approved"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "utterance",
      "external_id": "u_c1_diplomatic_disagreement_misgiving",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "c1-diplomatic-disagreement-02",
        "text": {
          "en": "My main misgiving is not the objective itself but the assumption that the same approach will work in every context."
        },
        "translations": {
          "fa": "نگرانی اصلی من خود هدف نیست، بلکه فرض اینه که یک رویکرد در همه زمینه‌ها جواب می‌ده."
        },
        "intent": "state_misgiving",
        "concept_refs": [
          "c1_diplomatic_disagreement_misgiving",
          "c1_diplomatic_disagreement_premise"
        ],
        "cefr": "C1",
        "topic": "polite-language",
        "register": "neutral",
        "status": "approved"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "utterance",
      "external_id": "u_c1_diplomatic_disagreement_common",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "c1-diplomatic-disagreement-03",
        "text": {
          "en": "There is more common ground here than it first appears: we agree on the problem, but not on the mechanism."
        },
        "translations": {
          "fa": "اینجا زمینه مشترک بیشتر از چیزیه که اول به نظر میاد: روی مشکل توافق داریم، ولی روی سازوکار نه."
        },
        "intent": "identify_common_ground",
        "concept_refs": [
          "c1_diplomatic_disagreement_common_ground",
          "c1_diplomatic_disagreement_objection"
        ],
        "cefr": "C1",
        "topic": "polite-language",
        "register": "neutral",
        "status": "approved"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "utterance",
      "external_id": "u_c1_diplomatic_disagreement_dismiss",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "c1-diplomatic-disagreement-03",
        "text": {
          "en": "I would not dismiss that concern; I just think it should be weighed against the cost of delaying the decision."
        },
        "translations": {
          "fa": "اون نگرانی رو رد نمی‌کنم؛ فقط فکر می‌کنم باید در برابر هزینه به تعویق انداختن تصمیم سنجیده بشه."
        },
        "intent": "acknowledge_concern",
        "concept_refs": [
          "c1_diplomatic_disagreement_dismiss",
          "c1_diplomatic_disagreement_constructive"
        ],
        "cefr": "C1",
        "topic": "polite-language",
        "register": "neutral",
        "status": "approved"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "utterance",
      "external_id": "u_c1_diplomatic_disagreement_soft",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "c1-diplomatic-disagreement-03",
        "text": {
          "en": "I see why that argument is attractive, though I'm not convinced it holds once we include the implementation costs."
        },
        "translations": {
          "fa": "می‌فهمم چرا اون استدلال جذابه، ولی وقتی هزینه اجرا رو وارد کنیم قانع نیستم همچنان برقرار بمونه."
        },
        "intent": "disagree_diplomatically",
        "concept_refs": [
